# The fortified turtle, gun-wall arm (turtle 85, riposte 1, guns 2): the
# evolve1-g4m2-turtle85r hold and counter-punch with two top-tier gun
# turret chains walked behind it -- the community's fortified-zone
# teeth, the unit every written account of beating Impossible names
# (community-play-strategies). The static fortress alone died faster at
# Impossible than the champion (imp-fortress12, log 2026-08-07) and the
# turret cover alone regressed at Hard (cover24), but neither stood
# behind a held army with a counter-punch, which is the posture the
# guides describe as a whole. Built for impfort96 beside the creep arm.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
